data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt_3_25179e69-181b-4369-b8d4-3008e7f86b41","delta":"Your"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt_3_25179e69-181b-4369-b8d4-3008e7f86b41","delta":" Gmail account isn't connected to Maple yet. To send email summaries like"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt_3_25179e69-181b-4369-b8d4-3008e7f86b41","delta":" this, you'll need to connect Gmail — a connect card should have appeared for"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt_3_25179e69-181b-4369-b8d4-3008e7f86b41","delta":" you to authorize it. Once that's done, I can send this"}

data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt_3_25179e69-181b-4369-b8d4-3008e7f86b41","delta":" right over."}

